#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Writes this case's fixture data into the run's workspace (both arms see the same files).
# Generated by benchmarks/builder; edit the case script there, not this file.
set -euo pipefail
mkdir -p resources
cat > resources/lift_study_readout.md <<'DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF'
# Marigold Pet Supply: display conversion lift study, September 2026 (agency readout)

Design: users randomly split 80% treatment (our display ads) / 20% control (charity PSA in the same slots), 1-30 September.

- Conversion rate: treatment 1.78% vs control 1.56%, lift 14.3%.
- Incremental conversions: 7,111 - 1,556 = 5,555.
- Campaign cost: 6,690,233 impressions at €3.10 CPM = €20,740. Incremental profit at €30 per conversion: €166,650. POAS 7.0.
- Lift is 15.8% on weekdays vs 10.4% at weekends.

Recommendations: switch display to a weekday-only schedule and double the budget.
DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF
